# ReflecToes

> Reflective safety gear for runners, cyclists, and walkers. ReflecToes uses bio-motion — the natural movement of your ankles, hands, and torso — to make wearers instantly recognizable to drivers in low-light and nighttime conditions. Backed by peer-reviewed pedestrian visibility research.

Founded by Ben O'Brien, a product development specialist who created reflective materials for Nike and Under Armour at Avery Dennison. Core insight: moving retroreflectors on joints (bio-motion) are detected by drivers at far greater distances, and trigger faster recognition, than static reflective vests or patches. ReflecToes is a trademark of OSUSANNAH LLC, St. George, Utah.

Available at reflectoes.com, Amazon, Walmart, Faire, eBay, and Etsy. Contact: info@reflectoes.com

